Z||000014||WhiteFieroBlur||11-27-2001||01:51 PM||||Well I had a close call last night. I am a person who never thought I would ever have anyone try to break into my car. I was inside listening to music and all I heard was a car shoot off from the front of my house and my alarm was going off. I ran outside and could hear like a modified exhaust honda driving away. I looked and no damage just my door was partial open but not fully open. So I dunno what they were doing to my car.<P> I am glad my first thing was put an alarm on my car. I have the ungo Clarion alarm and I love it. I somtimes thought I wished I got the talking viper. And everyone knows I have a system so I guess thats what they were after. Whats worse is I think its this honda on my street at the end of the street but I am not sure. <P> man people these days, they need to go out and buy there own stuff. I was suggest getting an alarm on a fiero, we draw alot of attention and I bet my stuff would not have been there if I had no alarm.||||reg||1
